#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:23 fd14c4b061b746b293133fea4b7c9ec1
msgid "DS-TWR Ranging Principle"
msgstr "DS-TWR 测距原理"

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:25 8e02ad2f90c74cc7b8299fd6357995b0
msgid ""
"The simple examples use a three-message double-sided two-way ranging "
"exchange:"
msgstr "简单示例使用由三条消息组成的双边双向测距交互："

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:27 98510eb508384a548c07e1bf97ab5763
msgid ""
"The Tag transmits a Poll frame and records the Poll TX timestamp ``T1``. "
"The Anchor receives it and records the Poll RX timestamp ``T2``."
msgstr "Tag 发送 Poll 帧并记录 Poll 发送时间戳 ``T1``。Anchor 接收该帧并记录 Poll 接收时间戳 ``T2``。"

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:29 9be4c956e5f34e989ce8c56b1406cf8c
msgid ""
"The Anchor transmits a Response frame and records the Response TX "
"timestamp ``T3``. The Tag receives it and records the Response RX "
"timestamp ``T4``."
msgstr ""
"Anchor 发送 Response 帧并记录 Response 发送时间戳 ``T3``。Tag 接收该帧并记录 Response 接收时间戳 "
"``T4``。"

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:31 98c757336afe40d089b73f0a8decdcfc
msgid ""
"The Tag schedules a delayed Final frame, records its TX timestamp ``T5``,"
" and includes ``T1``, ``T4``, and ``T5`` in the frame. The Anchor "
"receives the Final frame and records timestamp ``T6``."
msgstr ""
"Tag 延时发送 Final 帧，记录其发送时间戳 ``T5``，并在帧中携带 ``T1``、``T4`` 和 ``T5``。Anchor 接收 "
"Final 帧并记录时间戳 ``T6``。"

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:35 bdd03c8e4be643e79b1253b745b4451c
msgid ""
"The examples use the following compact frame format. Multi-byte values "
"are little-endian, and the sequence number associates the three frames:"
msgstr "示例使用以下简化帧格式。多字节数值采用小端序，序列号用于关联三种帧："

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:38 47333e864dbe4f1b8c35314929a0f774
msgid "Poll: ``[0x01, sequence]``"
msgstr "Poll 帧：``[0x01, sequence]``"

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:39 933eb439b11940e0bab745154ec98d82
msgid "Response: ``[0x02, sequence]``"
msgstr "Response 帧：``[0x02, sequence]``"

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:40 0f07c72d586e47aebd212b18e62ad482
msgid ""
"Final: ``[0x03, sequence, T1, T4, T5]``, where each timestamp occupies "
"the low 32 bits of a device timestamp"
msgstr "Final 帧：``[0x03, sequence, T1, T4, T5]``，其中每个时间戳使用设备时间戳的低 32 位"

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:43 02e8a621063e4075ae471393273e9e52
msgid ""
"The Anchor calculates the time of flight while handling 32-bit timestamp "
"wraparound:"
msgstr "Anchor 在处理 32 位时间戳回绕的同时计算飞行时间："

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:56 700c8eb188914102abd9cca3e89b13ed
msgid ""
"``DWT_TIME_UNITS`` is ``1 / (499200000 * 128)`` seconds. The Anchor "
"prints the calculated distance locally. This simplified protocol does not"
" send the distance back to the Tag."
msgstr ""
"``DWT_TIME_UNITS`` 为 ``1 / (499200000 * 128)`` 秒。Anchor "
"在本地打印计算得到的距离。该简化协议不会将距离回传给 Tag。"

