#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:66 6d0253c776eb426281e2f9a1a87532a1
msgid "Open the |stampc5_uwb_simple_anchor.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |stampc5_uwb_simple_anchor.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:68 ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:93
#: eb45aa9511574940a960c092f74e5992
msgid ""
"The anchor receives Poll and Final frames, calculates the distance "
"locally, and prints the non-negative ranging result."
msgstr "Anchor 接收 Poll 帧和 Final 帧，在本地计算距离，并打印非负的测距结果。"

