#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:223 e5f178cabf734810a658d69a49711c3c
msgid ""
"Preamble length in symbols. Allowed values are ``32``, ``64``, ``72``, "
"``128``, ``256``, ``512``, ``1024``, ``1536``, ``2048``, and ``4096``. "
"Default is ``128``."
msgstr ""
"前导码长度，单位为符号。可选值为 "
"``32``、``64``、``72``、``128``、``256``、``512``、``1024``、``1536``、``2048`` 和"
" ``4096``。默认值为 ``128``。"

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:224 4b1bc89172cd4a6e81cb8695bd140a0f
msgid ""
"Preamble acquisition chunk size. Allowed values are ``4``, ``8``, ``16``,"
" and ``32``. Default is ``8``."
msgstr "前导码捕获块大小。可选值为 ``4``、``8``、``16`` 和 ``32``。默认值为 ``8``。"

