msgid "TX preamble code, range ``9`` to ``12``. Default is ``9``."
msgstr "TX 前导码编码，范围为 ``9`` 到 ``12``。默认值为 ``9``。"

#: ../../source/stamp/uwb.rst:226 aa5590cb9778415bbc29becdd1967917
